        527.443359375,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "There are two primary objectives of screening for TB disease: the first objective is to ensure that TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.6206665039062,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "disease is detected early and treatment is initiated promptly, with the ultimate aim of reducing the risk",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.984739303588867,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.3565673828125,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "of poor treatment outcomes, health sequelae and the adverse social and economic consequences of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.99384880065918,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.4475708007812,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "TB; the second objective is to reduce the community-level prevalence of TB disease, thus reducing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        117.39674377441406,
        527.302490234375,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "Mycobacterium tuberculosis transmission of   and averting future incident TB. Beyond TB disease,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.63671875,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "screening can also identify individuals who are eligible for and would benefit from TB preventive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        459.10650634765625,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "treatment (TPT) once TB disease is ruled out, thus further averting future incident TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.2946319580078,
        527.2064208984375,
        182.7376251220703
      ],
      "text": "Arising from these two primary objectives, there are two primary levels at which screening can",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.49464416503906,
        527.2210693359375,
        195.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "augment standard TB care practices: that of the individual and the community. For individuals with TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.987942695617676,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.69459533691406,
        527.436767578125,
        209.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "disease, screening interventions can speed up and improve the probability of receiving a diagnosis",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.2978515625,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "and initiating treatment by bypassing many of the barriers to diagnosis and care that people suffering",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.980732917785645,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        218.3007354736328,
        251.076416015625,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "(6) from TB disease can face, including :",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        242.79859924316406,
        343.92694091796875,
        257.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "•\t lacking knowledge about the signs and symptoms of TB;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.9987335205078,
        210.59812927246094,
        270.4417419433594
      ],
      "text": "•\t not recognizing symptoms;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.1986083984375,
        420.9875183105469,
        283.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "•\t being unable to seek care or lacking sufficient resources for care-seeking;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        282.39862060546875,
        336.486572265625,
        296.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "•\t lacking access to TB diagnostic and treatment services;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        295.5986328125,
        527.4422607421875,
        310.0416564941406
      ],
      "text": "•\t seeking care from providers who lack sufficient knowledge of TB or in facilities where TB diagnosis",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        308.798583984375,
        368.4027099609375,
        323.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "and treatment services are not available or of sufficient quality.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        330.5025939941406,
        527.4024658203125,
        344.94561767578125
      ],
      "text": "Beyond improving individual health and welfare, screening interventions for infectious diseases such",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        343.7025146484375,
        527.1340942382812,
        358.1455383300781
      ],
      "text": "as TB also address the epidemiology of the disease at the community level. By identifying and treating",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.975221633911133,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        356.9026184082031,
        527.3828735351562,
        371.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "a proportion of the pool of individuals with TB disease in a given community, screening for TB seeks",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        370.10260009765625,
        527.4157104492188,
        384.5456237792969
      ],
      "text": "to reduce the prevalence, transmission and future incidence of the disease, with the long-term goal",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        383.3025207519531,
        287.7795104980469,
        397.74554443359375
      ],
      "text": "of eliminating the disease from the population.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        405.0065002441406,
        527.394775390625,
        419.44952392578125
      ],
      "text": "The recommendations in this document apply to screening interventions that are conducted for the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        418.2065124511719,
        527.4354248046875,
        432.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "purpose of directly benefitting the individuals being screened by improving TB case detection and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        431.406494140625,
        502.2444152832031,
        445.8495178222656
      ],
      "text": "care and, thereby, benefitting the larger community by reducing the population burden of TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        459.83770751953125,
        321.32977294921875,
        484.6327209472656
      ],
      "text": "1.3 Scope of the 2021 update",
